Application-loadable ICD exports (Android WSI + generic ICD symbols).

The generic Vulkan ICD entry points every alternate-driver loader needs:

- vk_icdGetInstanceProcAddr
- vk_icdGetPhysicalDeviceProcAddr
- vk_icdNegotiateLoaderICDInterfaceVersion

Upstream's Android version script (src/vulkan/vulkan-android.sym) exports
only HMI (HAL modules are loaded by the system libvulkan, not dlopened by
apps). This overlay adds vulkan-app-loader.sym (HMI + ICD symbols) and the
app-loader patch switches the Android link to it. This repository only ever
builds panvk for Android (gallium-drivers=, vulkan-drivers=panfrost), so the
global swap is safe here; the HAL-only script stays untouched for reference.
